# PixiJS Docs First

- Before writing or updating PixiJS code, look up the relevant API in the local docs index:
  - `documentation/pixi-api-links.json`
  - `npm run pixi:lookup -- <query>`
- Use the latest PixiJS API patterns (v8), avoid deprecated properties.
- Prefer official docs wording for API usage and property names.
